The '''Archery Range''' is a [[Locations|Location]] found in the [[Village]] near {{NPCSprite|Rosetta}}. It is where {{NPCSprite|Jax}} can be found, and where the player can complete Target Practice.

{{ZoneText
|Talk to Jax to forge special arrows!}}

== Target Practice ==
Once having talked to {{NPCSprite|Jax}} for the first time, the player can begin Target Practice. There are four tiers, and completing the first three will fully unlock [[Jax]]'s shop.

Target Practice begins once the player stands on the {{Item|Heavy Weighted Pressure Plate|text=Pressure Plate|link=}} in the center of the room. The player will have {{Green|3}} seconds to prepare before the practice starts. There are {{Item|Redstone Lamp|amount=16|link=}}s around the room, and the player must shoot all of them in the required time frame without moving off the pressure plate.

